    * Report the sanitized endpoint actually supplied to SymcorCoreAdapter, including enough information to distinguish scheme, host, port, and path.
    * Preserve existing profile/provenance reporting and established summary fields where possible; clearly distinguish configured and effective destinations.
    * Reuse existing sanitization. Do not expose credentials, tokens, or sensitive query values.
    * Ensure reporting and request construction use the same resolved endpoint.

